 "Every fact is copied from the fellowship’s own pages, and each entry links to the page it was checked on. A place is on a map only when the fellowship’s own finder (or the host’s own page) lists it; its street address is placed by the US Census Bureau’s geocoder. A church is on a map only when the Southern Baptist Convention (or its Florida convention) lists it, or another sound denomination or network, or its own website, shows that it holds to the gospel with men as its pastors and elders; and nothing found on its own website affirms same-sex relationships, shows a woman as pastor or elder, names a liberal denomination or teaches the prosperity gospel. Southern Baptist churches are spread across each map rather than all shown, so pins never crowd. Listing a fellowship is not an endorsement of every group that meets under its name.": "每一项事实都摘自该团契自己的网页，每个条目都链接到核实所用的网页。只有当团契自己的查询工具（或主办方自己的网页）列出某地点时，它才会出现在地图上；街道地址由美国人口普查局的地理编码器定位。只有当美南浸信会（或其佛罗里达分会）列出某教会，或另一个纯正的宗派或网络、或教会自己的网站表明它持守福音、并由男性担任牧师和长老时，它才会出现在地图上；并且在其网站上找不到任何内容认可同性关系、显示女性担任牧师或长老、列明属于自由派宗派或教导成功神学。美南浸信会的教会在各地图上分散显示而非全部列出，使标记不致拥挤。列出某团契并不代表认可以其名义聚会的每一个小组。",
 "{n} places where these fellowships meet, each listed by the fellowship’s own finder and found on the map by its street address.": "这些团契聚会的 {n} 个地点，每个都由团契自己的查询工具列出，并按街道地址标在地图上。",
